{"id":"0b2170bf5b3075ce","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-representability.md","title":"Representability Theorem","display":"thm-representability — Representability Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-representability","aliases":["92-thm-representability"],"display":"thm-representability — Representability Theorem","depends_on":["[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-representable]]","[[92-df-diagonal-function]]","[[92-df-recursive-set]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-theory-set]]"],"source":"第 VIII 章 pp. 97–102（PDF 114–119）","source_status":"原书关系可定义性的本地强度推广"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-representability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-representability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-representability — Representability Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9d845f6cd765d21\" href=\"?note=d9d845f6cd765d21\" title=\"92-df-representable\">92-df-representable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6ad30e82597031a6\" href=\"?note=6ad30e82597031a6\" title=\"92-df-diagonal-function\">92-df-diagonal-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d4d93aba49d678d8\" href=\"?note=d4d93aba49d678d8\" title=\"92-df-recursive-set\">92-df-recursive-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"975b3aa9a1e08797\" href=\"?note=975b3aa9a1e08797\" title=\"92-df-theory-set\">92-df-theory-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 VIII 章 pp. 97–102（PDF 114–119）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书关系可定义性的本地强度推广"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (set parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecSet}\">\\(\\mathrm{RecSet}\\)</span> (recursive-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d4d93aba49d678d8\" href=\"?note=d4d93aba49d678d8\" title=\"92-df-recursive-set\">92-df-recursive-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> (arithmetic-strength assumption, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"975b3aa9a1e08797\" href=\"?note=975b3aa9a1e08797\" title=\"92-df-theory-set\">92-df-theory-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_G\\)</span> (representability predicate in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"d9d845f6cd765d21\" href=\"?note=d9d845f6cd765d21\" title=\"92-df-representable\">92-df-representable</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}representability}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\mathrm{RecSet}(A)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Rep}_G(A))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}representability}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\mathrm{RecSet}(A)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Rep}_G(A))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_G(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_G(A)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>中可表示 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"d9d845f6cd765d21\" href=\"?note=d9d845f6cd765d21\" title=\"92-df-representable\">92-df-representable</a>)</li>\n<li>可表示性定理：递归集在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>中可表示</li>\n<li>这是证明不完备性的技术基础</li>\n<li>函数的可表示性须通过编码图另行表达；本定理本身只处理自然数集合</li>\n<li>原书以构造算术关系、分离与强可定义性组织证明，仍然显式使用 Gödel 编码</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>本条针对旧 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_G\\)</span> 的正负数码定义，不是第 VII 章“所有 c.e. 集合可表示”的 Shepherdson 定理。原书不用通常的 PR 函数归纳作为主证明路线，而由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 关系分离得到递归关系可定义。图码集合的可定义性与原书函数强可定义性亦应区别。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 VIII 章 pp. 97–102（PDF 114–119）。</p>\n<p>算术强度核对：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> 表示每条 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 公理在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 中可证，不要求是原始公理。当前 P.A. 采用六条基本公理加归纳，后继前身公理由归纳导出，见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"0a1ba58f66cc8d4e\" href=\"?note=0a1ba58f66cc8d4e\" title=\"92-lem-local-pa-proves-q\">92-lem-local-pa-proves-q</a>；若继续要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span>，就无法把本条应用于当前固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-representable","status":"resolved","id":"d9d845f6cd765d21","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-representable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-diagonal-function","status":"resolved","id":"6ad30e82597031a6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-diagonal-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-set","status":"resolved","id":"d4d93aba49d678d8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-recursive-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"468d35690d25ee42","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-set","status":"resolved","id":"975b3aa9a1e08797","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-theory-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G$ (system G, see [[92-df-g-system]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-set","status":"resolved","id":"d4d93aba49d678d8","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RecSet}$ (recursive-set predicate, see [[92-df-recursive-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"reso